rolling=\"no\" title=\"ScrollTrigger.scrollerProxy() smooth-scrollbar demo\" src=\"https://codepen.io/GreenSock/embed/GRovmPr?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/GreenSock/pen/GRovmPr\">\r\n  ScrollTrigger.scrollerProxy() smooth-scrollbar demo</a> by GSAP (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/GreenSock\">@GreenSock</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<h3 id=\"asscroll\" style=\"position:relative;\">ASScroll<a href=\"#asscroll\" aria-label=\"asscroll permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>gitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/ashthornton/asscroll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ASScroll</a></li>\n</ul>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"ASScroll × GSAP ScrollTrigger\" src=\"https://codepen.io/GreenSock/embed/rNyyxBP?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/GreenSock/pen/rNyyxBP\">\r\n  ASScroll × GSAP ScrollTrigger</a> by GSAP (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/GreenSock\">@GreenSock</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p>ScrollTrigger.scrollerProxy()은 GSAP 3.4.0 버전에 추가되었습니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://gsap.com/docs/v3/Plugins/ScrollTrigger/static.scrollerProxy()/\" target=\"_